          "id": 1143711994,
          "type": null,
          "body": "The columns are back but sort not working for the text columns (`Country`, `City`, `AS Organization`).  \nSort on `AS Number` ok.  \n  \nAdd https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/release-3.6/ui/qt/endpoint_dialog.cpp#L456\n```\n        case ENDP_COLUMN_GEO_COUNTRY:\n        case ENDP_COLUMN_GEO_CITY:\n        case ENDP_COLUMN_GEO_AS_ORG:\n        {\n            QString this_str = data(sort_col, Qt::DisplayRole).toString();\n            QString other_str = other_row->data(sort_col, Qt::DisplayRole).toString();\n            return (this_str < other_str);\n        }\n```\n\nto  \nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/ui/qt/widgets/traffic_tree.cpp#L344  ???",
